00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:09.320
We use tests to figure out that when we've done them, they continue to be

75
00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:14.040
the right things, their measurements, to see if we've achieved our goals.

76
00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:17.880
But for that, we've got to define what our goals are,

77
00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.000
and we can't even further

