00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:11.520
here's my test.

91
00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:15.480
It's just going to reinforce the wrongness that I wrote into that function.

92
00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:20.480
All that a test can do at that point, because the only input it's got

93
00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:25.000
is the test is the is the working code is verified that the working code does

