00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:48.440
and give us something a little bit different every time.

218
00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:51.440
Certainly in the earlier versions

219
00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:54.880
of AI coding assistance, we've all seen that.

220
00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:58.320
Where we've asked system to build something,

221
00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:01.440
you ask it the same thing again and you get something very different.

